{"id":"wb-8-524","name":"南开大学思源堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"思源堂","text":"思源堂坐落于天津市南开区卫津路94号南开大学校园内，始建于1923年，是美国洛克菲勒基金会与企业家袁述之捐资兴建的科学楼，现在作为医学院使用的第二教学楼。该建筑为重点保护等级历史风貌建筑。2019年10月，思源堂被列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%80%9D%E6%BA%90%E5%A0%82","revisionId":88033677,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88033677","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/73471c22c178d0a37f624998.jpg","title":"天津南开大学思源堂.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%8D%97%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E6%80%9D%E6%BA%90%E5%A0%82.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%8D%97%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E6%80%9D%E6%BA%90%E5%A0%82.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Peter Guo","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"天津南开大学思源堂","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"思源堂"}}